{"id":"vod_sn_38235","vodId":"38235","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"火影忍者：博人传之次世代继承者","name_cn":"火影忍者：博人传之次世代继承者","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第293集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/2d454a0c1e17b6bedfe902a0c4efe2c9.jpg"},"summary":"随着和平的到来而走向近代化的木叶忍者村。高楼林立，巨大显示屏中播放出影像，连结各区域的电车在村里奔驰。虽说是忍者村，但一般民众也增多，忍者的生存方式也在逐渐改变的这个时代——　　村子的领袖，第七代火影·漩涡鸣人的儿子慕留人，进入了培育忍者的学校“忍者学校”。周围的学生们带着“火影的儿子”这样偏见的目光看待慕留人，但慕留人凭借天生的破天荒性格将这种小事轻松越过！　　慕留人与新的伙伴相遇，他将如何挑战突然发生的神秘事件？　　在众人心中如疾风般狂奔的“漩涡慕留人”的物语，现在开始！！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:59:34","playable":true,"episodeCount":293,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ct7unhx2Ah1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Sc3tCBskuU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iamMVyt5ZV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QjxPDLbjKn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H7476YwfVy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SwF5KfrARq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jbYy9RUM6V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1WMfsmGTXM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8UD3xN6NL91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EyPDf74eEg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tXC0hW8BEm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t6JAS4GGM81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/amtyL8gs4v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gajWM6s2FM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.